<html>
  <head>
    <title>Verify Your Account</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .warning { color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Verify Your Account</h2>

      <p>Hello {{fullname}},</p>

      <p>Thank you for registering. Please use the following One-Time Password (OTP) to verify your account:</p>

      <p style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; padding: 20px; background-color: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px;">{{otp}}</p>

      <p>This OTP will expire in <strong>{{expireMinutes}} minutes</strong>.</p>

      <p class="warning">⚠️ Important:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>If you didn't create an account, please ignore this email</li>
        <li>Do not share this OTP with anyone</li>
      </ul>

      <p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br>
      The Support Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
